      "representative_excerpt": "Why not make retroactive to the day it was signed into law. Many of us put our lives on the line. Some never get injured. Some of us got injured and can no longer perform the job without furthering the injury. I have 17 years LEO coverage. I am going to lose 17 years of LEO pension and benefits for defending my country. Please reconsider....",
