      "representative_excerpt": "I strongly support the proposed First Responder Fair RETIRE Act regulations under Docket OPM-2024-0014. Federal law enforcement officers and other first responders accept careers that routinely require them to place their health and safety at risk in service to others. When an employee suffers a serious injury in the performance of those duties and can no...",
