      "representative_excerpt": "I support the proposed plan of helping those who suffer an illness or injury while on-duty. In my personal experience, I have sustained injuries while on-duty, though not to the extent that I would need to change positions. However, it would give me more peace of mind knowing that I could be covered on the enhanced retirement benefits in the event that I...",
